cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "A TEI/EpiDoc Corpus of the Eastern Necropolis of Iulia Concordia"
abstract: >-
  Born-digital TEI/EpiDoc critical editions of the inscriptions from the
  Eastern Necropolis (Necropoli di Levante, or Sepolcreto dei Militi) of
  Iulia Concordia (Concordia Sagittaria, Italy), datable between the second
  or third and the early fifth century AD, now preserved in the Museo
  Nazionale Concordiese di Portogruaro. Each file includes an interpretative
  transcription, critical apparatus, translation, commentary, bibliography,
  and detailed prosopographical data, with taxonomies linked to external
  authority files. The repository also contains the XSLT stylesheets and
  Python scripts that generate the project website.
